15:  *    - Native window.PalmServiceBridge
16:  *    - Native window.WebOSServiceBridge
17:  *    - window.webOSTV.service.request / window.webOS.service.request
18:  *    - Retention in window._cinejoyLunaBridge to prevent GC socket teardown
19:  *    - Graceful fallback when no bridge is present (browser/Node)
20:  * 4. Dynamic Port Updating:
